     by AV, 9-Nov-2024.) $)
  lngndxnitvndx $p |- ( LineG ` ndx ) =/= ( Itv ` ndx ) $=
    ( cnx clng cfv citv wne c1 c7 cdc c6 1nn0 6nn decnncl nnrei 6nn0 6lt7 declt
