    $d d f g i n p G $.  $d a b c d f g i j n p s t u v x y z I $.
    $d a b c d f g i j n p s t u v x y z P $.
    $d a b c d f g i j n p u v x y z .- $.
    istrkg.p $e |- P = ( Base ` G ) $.
    istrkg.d $e |- .- = ( dist ` G ) $.
    istrkg.i $e |- I = ( Itv ` G ) $.
