      ( cv co wcel wral vi vp vf weq wi wrex cpw w3a citv cfv wsbc cstrkgb wceq
      wa cbs simpl simpr oveqd eleq2d raleqbidv anbi12d rexeqbidv imbi12d pweqd
      imbi1d 2ralbidv 3anbi123d sbcie2s df-trkgb elab4g ) BQZAQZVLUAQZRZSZABUDZ
