      FNZBOGNZBODLUBUCDLPGAQFAQRSADABCCDEEFGHHIITUA $.

    $d G a b f g $.  $d H a b $.  $d a b ph $.
    motgrp.1 $e |- ( ph -> G e. V ) $.
    ${
      $d A a b $.  $d B a b $.  $d .- a b $.
