  ${
    $d w g $.
    $( Define the class of right angles.  Definition 8.1 of [Schwabhauser]
       p. 57.  See ~ israg .  (Contributed by Thierry Arnoux, 25-Aug-2019.) $)
    df-rag $a |- raG = ( g e. _V |-> { w e. Word ( Base ` g ) | ( ( # ` w ) = 3
      /\ ( ( w ` 0 ) ( dist ` g ) ( w ` 2 ) ) = ( ( w ` 0 ) ( dist ` g )
      ( ( ( pInvG ` g ) ` ( w ` 1 ) ) ` ( w ` 2 ) ) ) ) } ) $.
  $}

  $c perpG $.

  $( Declare the constant for the perpendicular relation. $)
  cperpg $a class perpG $.

  ${
