      [_ { d e. ( p ^m ( 0 ..^ 3 ) ) | ( ( d ` 0 ) =/= ( d ` 1 )
                                      /\ ( d ` 1 ) =/= ( d ` 2 ) ) } / a ]_ (
      { <. ( Base ` ndx ) , a >. ,
        <. ( +g ` ndx ) , ( e e. a , f e. a |-> if ( ( e ` 0 ) e. ( ( e ` 1 )
                     ( LineG ` g ) ( e ` 2 ) ) , <" ( f ` 0 ) ( f ` 1 )
          ( iota_ z e. p ( <" ( f ` 2 ) ( f ` 1 ) z "> ( cgrA ` g ) e
         /\ ( ( f ` 1 ) ( dist ` g ) z ) = ( ( e ` 1 ) ( dist ` g ) ( e ` 0 ) )
                                        ) ) "> , <" ( e ` 0 ) ( e ` 1 )
          ( iota_ z e. p ( <" ( e ` 2 ) ( e ` 1 ) z "> ( cgrA ` g ) f
         /\ ( ( e ` 1 ) ( dist ` g ) z ) = ( ( f ` 1 ) ( dist ` g ) ( f ` 0 ) )
         /\ ( ( ( e ` 1 ) ( LineG ` g ) ( e ` 2 ) )
              i^i ( z ( Itv ` g ) ( e ` 0 ) ) ) =/= (/) ) ) "> ) ) >. ,
        <. ( le ` ndx ) , ( leA ` g ) >. } /s ( cgrA ` g ) ) ) $.
  $}

