    iseqlg.b $e |- ( ph -> B e. P ) $.
    iseqlg.c $e |- ( ph -> C e. P ) $.
    $( Property of a triangle being equilateral.  (Contributed by Thierry
       Arnoux, 5-Oct-2020.) $)
    iseqlg $p |- ( ph -> ( <" A B C "> e. ( eqltrG ` G ) <->
        <" A B C "> ( cgrG ` G ) <" B C A "> ) ) $=
