  ${
    $d A i j $.  $d B i j $.  $d C i j $.  $d N i j $.
    $( Lemma for ~ colinearalg .  Translate between two forms of the
       colinearity condition.  (Contributed by Scott Fenton, 24-Jun-2013.) $)
    colinearalglem2 $p |- (
       ( A e. ( EE ` N ) /\ B e. ( EE ` N ) /\ C e. ( EE ` N ) ) ->
       ( A. i e. ( 1 ... N ) A. j e. ( 1 ... N )
         ( ( ( B ` i ) - ( A ` i ) ) x. ( ( C ` j ) - ( A ` j ) ) ) =
         ( ( ( B ` j ) - ( A ` j ) ) x. ( ( C ` i ) - ( A ` i ) ) )
         <->
         A. i e. ( 1 ... N ) A. j e. ( 1 ... N )
