    $( Euclid's axiom.  Take an angle ` B A C ` and a point ` D ` between ` B `
       and ` C ` .  Now, if you extend the segment ` A D ` to a point ` T ` ,
       then ` T ` lies between two points ` x ` and ` y ` that lie on the
